### ===================================
### AI Assistant API Tests
### Base Path: /api/ai
### ===================================

### ----- Translation -----

### Direct Translation - English to Chinese
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/directly-translation/zh/Hello%20World

###

### Direct Translation - English to Japanese
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/directly-translation/ja/Good%20morning

###

### Direct Translation - English to Korean
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/directly-translation/ko/Thank%20you

###

### Direct Translation - Long Text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/directly-translation/zh/The%20quick%20brown%20fox%20jumps%20over%20the%20lazy%20dog

###

### ----- Translation with Explanation -----

### Translation and Explanation - Chinese
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/translation-and-explanation/zh/Break%20a%20leg

###

### Translation and Explanation - Japanese
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/translation-and-explanation/ja/It%27s%20raining%20cats%20and%20dogs

###

### ----- Grammar -----

### Grammar Explanation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/grammar-explanation/zh/I%20have%20been%20working%20here%20for%20five%20years

###

### Grammar Explanation - Complex Sentence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/grammar-explanation/zh/Had%20I%20known%20about%20the%20meeting%2C%20I%20would%20have%20attended

###

### Grammar Correction
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/grammar-correction/zh/She%20don%27t%20like%20apples

###

### Grammar Correction - Multiple Errors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/grammar-correction/zh/Me%20and%20him%20goes%20to%20school%20everyday

###

